caption d into a file the branch did not touch, then c: back to the hunk left (#239)
key /
type REFUNDED
key Enter d
wait REFUNDED → OrderStatus.REFUNDED (via OrderStatus)
key c
wait :1  [code]  hunk
caption on a file the branch did not touch the status bar shows no review counters (#286)
key /
type REFUNDED
key Enter d
wait [code]  REFUNDED → OrderStatus.REFUNDED (via OrderStatus)
key c
wait :1  [code]  hunk
caption the lines a branch deleted are lines of the text: c stands on the first, the status bar reads its old number (#439)
key C C C C
wait app/repos.py  -32:1  [code]  hunk 1/1  file 2/8
caption / finds the deleted text, Ctrl+C copies the deleted line, and an edit there is refused (#439)
key /
type orders.clear
key Enter
wait app/repos.py  -59:14  [code]  hunk 1/1  file 2/8  1/1
key C-c
wait copied 1 line
run $SMOKE_TMUX show-buffer | grep -qx '        self.orders.clear()'
key Enter
wait -59:14  [code]  hunk 1/1  file 2/8  deleted
caption o lists the review's files first, with their panel letter (#246)
key o
wait Files (
type app/service.py
key Enter
caption u marks the uses on lines the branch changed with the gutter's bar (#246)
